        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Conversion Factors and Formulas\n\n- **Density**: % of density at sea level\n- **1 ft (foot)** = 0.3048 m\n- **1 in mercury (Hg)** = 3,376.8 N/m² (Pa) = 0.49 lb/in² (psi) = 12.8 in water\n- **Temperature Conversion**: T (°C) = 5/9 × (T (°F) - 32)"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "temperature_f",
          "label": "Temperature (°F)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 59,
          "unit": "°F"
        },
        {
          "id": "pressure_in_hg",
          "label": "Pressure (in. Hg)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 29.92,
          "unit": "in. Hg"
        },
        {
          "id": "density_percent",
          "label": "Density",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 100,
          "unit": "%"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "temperature_c",
          "label": "Temperature (°C)",
          "formula": "(inputs.temperature_f - 32) * 5 / 9",
          "unit": "°C",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "pressure_pa",
          "label": "Pressure (Pa)",
          "formula": "inputs.pressure_in_hg * 3376.8",
          "unit": "Pa",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "pressure_psi",
          "label": "Pressure (psi)",
          "formula": "inputs.pressure_in_hg * 0.49",
          "unit": "psi",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}